1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,210
Nobody asks to begin.
没有人请求开始。

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:06,150
One morning, you simply open your eyes.
某个清晨，你只是睁开了眼睛。

3
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:08,910
At first, everything is new.
一开始，一切都是新的。

4
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,500
Every flower is a wonder.
每一朵花都是奇迹。

5
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:13,140
Every fall feels like the end of the world…
每一次跌倒，都像是世界末日……

6
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,160
…until it isn't.
……直到你发现，并不是。

7
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:17,970
And you learn the oldest trick there is: get back up.
于是你学会了最古老的本事：站起来。

8
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:20,150
Then you grow.
然后，你长大了。

9
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,000
You ask questions no one can answer.
你问出没人能回答的问题。

10
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:24,280
You fall in love — a little too fast.
你坠入爱河——有点太快了。

11
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:25,840
You think you'll live forever.
你以为自己会永远活着。

12
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:28,290
And for a while, you're right.
有那么一阵子，你是对的。

13
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:31,800
Then the world hands you a hard hat and a heavy load.
后来，世界递给你一顶安全帽，和一副重担。

14
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:33,140
The days get shorter.
日子越来越短，

15
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:34,670
The worries get longer.
烦恼越来越长。

16
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:36,720
You fail. You try again.
你失败了，再试一次。

17
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:38,500
Some days, you just want to sleep.
有些日子，你只想睡一觉。

18
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:41,510
And then, someone small reaches for your hand…
直到有一天，一只小小的手拉住了你……

19
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:44,580
and suddenly, you understand what it was all for.
你忽然明白了，这一切是为了什么。

20
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:48,750
Time slows down… and somehow moves faster.
时间慢了下来……却又好像走得更快。

21
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,880
The people you love begin to leave.
你爱的人，开始一个个离开。

22
00:00:50,930 --> 00:00:52,370
You don't carry as much anymore.
你不再背负那么多了。

23
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:53,980
You don't need to.
也不再需要了。

24
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:57,970
In the end, a life isn't measured in years.
最后，人的一生不是用年岁来衡量的。

25
00:00:58,020 --> 00:01:00,480
It's measured in the moments you were truly there.
而是用那些你真正活过的瞬间。

26
00:01:00,530 --> 00:01:02,580
So close your eyes, gently.
所以，轻轻闭上眼吧。

27
00:01:02,630 --> 00:01:05,640
Somewhere, a new morning is just beginning.
在某个地方，新的清晨正要开始。

